# FCM / Firebase client configs — keep local only (GitHub secret scanning
# flags the embedded Google API key even when it is a restricted client key).
# Download from Firebase Console → repo root:
#   Android: `google-services.json` (template: `google-services.json.example`)
#   iOS: `GoogleService-Info.plist` (template: `GoogleService-Info.plist.example`)
# Local/cloud EAS archives still include these via `.easignore` (not listed there).
# EAS file-env: `GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON`, `GOOGLE_SERVICES_PLIST`.
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
# FCM service account private key (upload to EAS only — never commit).
fcm-service-account.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android

# Large uncut ambient source recordings (loops are committed as .m4a)
assets/audio/ambient/raw/

# Ad-hoc OCR / Python experiments (не коммитить случайные выгрузки)
.tmp_ocr/
__tmp_ocr/
.vercel
# Локальный HOME для `vercel` CLI (кэш, auth.json — не коммитить)
.vercel-home/

docs/.sync-logs/
